{"id":"n69157-1-9","stage":2,"title":"외투 · 外套","scene":"穿着与购物","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69157-1-9-1","ko":"생각보다 날씨가 쌀쌀하네.","zh":"天气比想象中还要冷呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"想法，展望","explanation":"생각：想法，展望；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"6","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"날씨가","meaning":"天气","explanation":"날씨：天气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"날씨","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60630","senseId":"1","lemma":"날씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쌀쌀하네.","meaning":"凉飕飕","explanation":"쌀쌀하다：凉飕飕；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"쌀쌀하다","audio":"/audio/86c4cc835736d4151f83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66104","senseId":"1","lemma":"쌀쌀하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，展望","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想象今后将要发生的事；或指那种想象。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"fe655cf1d979cf3d","term":"날씨","zh":"天气","audio":"/audio/fe655cf1d979cf3db76c.mp3","entryId":"60630","definition":"每天在气温或空气中出现的，如雨、云、风、雾等的状况。","pronunciation":["날씨"]},{"id":"86c4cc835736d415","term":"쌀쌀하다","zh":"凉飕飕","audio":"/audio/86c4cc835736d4151f83.mp3","entryId":"66104","definition":"天气凉，感觉稍冷。","pronunciation":["쌀쌀하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ed1680786ad8133679a1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69157-1-9-2","ko":"외투도 안 입고 반팔 하나만 입고 나오니까 그렇지.","zh":"因为没穿外套，只穿了件短袖，所以才会这样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"외투도","meaning":"外套","explanation":"외투：外套；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"외투","audio":"/audio/8b248df76bd9b98ffc4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69157","senseId":"1","lemma":"외투","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반팔","meaning":"短袖，半袖","explanation":"반팔：短袖，半袖","readings":[{"term":"반팔","audio":"/audio/240a1262715e0de076fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57628","senseId":"1","lemma":"반팔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하나만","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"입고","meaning":"穿","explanation":"입다：穿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"입다","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17174","senseId":"1","lemma":"입다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나오니까","meaning":"出，出来","explanation":"나오다：出，出来；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"1","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇지.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8b248df76bd9b98f","term":"외투","zh":"外套","audio":"/audio/8b248df76bd9b98ffc4f.mp3","entryId":"69157","definition":"像夹克或大衣一样为抵御寒冷而穿在外面的衣服。","pronunciation":["외ː투","웨ː투"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5e126f454a274733","term":"입다","zh":"穿","audio":"/audio/5e126f454a274733cfa2.mp3","entryId":"17174","definition":"将衣服披或裹在身上。","pronunciation":["입따"]},{"id":"240a1262715e0de0","term":"반팔","zh":"短袖，半袖","audio":"/audio/240a1262715e0de076fd.mp3","entryId":"57628","definition":"袖子长度较短、能露出胳膊肘的衣服。","pronunciation":["반ː팔"]},{"id":"556dcbf069a950eb","term":"하나","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3","entryId":"20279","definition":"数数时的第一个数字。","pronunciation":["하나"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"从里面到外面。","pronunciation":["나오다"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/f87acf6adad6dc5ec3b0.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.58,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=69157","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":88,"sequenceScore":2.4067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["因为没穿外套，只穿了件短袖，所以才会这样。","昨天看新闻了吗？听说抢银行的劫匪被抓了。","天气比想象中还要冷呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["因为没穿外套，只穿了件短袖，所以才会这样。","天气比想象中还要冷呢。","昨天看新闻了吗？听说抢银行的劫匪被抓了。"],"answer":0}]}
